---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-tw">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>關於小象 | elephlow</title>
  <meta name="description" content="關於小象（Elephlow）與「推開部屋的門」電子報" />
</head>
<body>

  <main class="home-window">

    <header class="window-titlebar">
      <div class="titlebar-left">
        <span class="title-dots">● ● ●</span>
        <span class="titlebar-text">elephlow.cc / 關於小象</span>
      </div>
      <div class="titlebar-right">
        <a href="/zh-cn/about" class="lang-link">简</a>
        <a href="/zh-tw/about" class="lang-link lang-active">繁</a>
        <a href="/en/about" class="lang-link">EN</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="window-content about-layout">

      <aside class="about-left sticky-sidebar">

        <div class="elephant-portrait">
          <img src="/logo.png" alt="elephlow" style="width: 120px; height: auto;" />
          <p class="elephant-caption">小象 / Elephlow</p>
        </div>
<div class="persona-card">
  <h3 class="card-title">✦ persona ✦</h3>
  <dl class="persona-list">
    
    <dt style="color: var(--tab-pink);">HANDLE</dt>
    <dd>暱稱：小象 / Elephlow</dd>

    <dt style="color: var(--tab-orange);">AKA</dt>
    <dd>曾用名：阿茶</dd>

    <dt style="color: var(--tab-blue);">SIGN</dt>
    <dd>星座：射手座</dd>

    <dt style="color: var(--tab-green);">TYPE</dt>
    <dd>MBTI：INFJ</dd>

    <dt style="color: var(--candy-purple);">BASE</dt>
    <dd>出沒：街巷、離島 🏝️</dd>

    <dt style="color: var(--tab-yellow);">MOTTO</dt>
    <dd>狀態：在邊緣捕捉與想像 🌈</dd>

    
  </dl>
</div>

        <div class="interests-card">
          <h3 class="card-title">✿ interests ✿</h3>
          <div class="pixel-bars">
            <div class="p-bar-group">
              <div class="p-bar-label"><span>港台流行音樂</span><span>85%</span></div>
              <div class="p-bar-track"><div class="p-bar-fill" style="width: 85%; background-color: var(--candy-pink);"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-bar-group">
              <div class="p-bar-label"><span>獨立雜誌與書店</span><span>95%</span></div>
              <div class="p-bar-track"><div class="p-bar-fill" style="width: 95%; background-color: var(--candy-mint);"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-bar-group">
              <div class="p-bar-label"><span>紀錄片影展</span><span>75%</span></div>
              <div class="p-bar-track"><div class="p-bar-fill" style="width: 75%; background-color: var(--candy-aqua);"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-bar-group">
              <div class="p-bar-label"><span>酷兒書寫</span><span>80%</span></div>
              <div class="p-bar-track"><div class="p-bar-fill" style="width: 80%; background-color: var(--candy-purple);"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-bar-group">
              <div class="p-bar-label"><span>Zine與藝術書展</span><span>90%</span></div>
              <div class="p-bar-track"><div class="p-bar-fill" style="width: 90%; background-color: var(--candy-cream);"></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="retro-stickers-area">
          <span class="r-sticker sticker-a">✄ 100% Zine Lover</span>
          <span class="r-sticker sticker-b">Queer & Proud ♡</span>
        </div>

        <a href="https://tally.so/r/4415XB" target="_blank" class="retro-s4-banner">
          <div class="s4-banner-inner">
            <span class="blink-text">✦ SEASON 04 ✦</span><br/>
            熱烈徵訂中 · 點擊訂閱
          </div>
        </a>

      </aside>

      <section class="about-center">
        <div class="qa-card">
          <h2 class="qa-title">⌒ 五問五答 ⌒</h2>
          <p class="qa-subtitle">獨自進行的訪談 ｡^‿^｡</p>

          <div class="qa-list">

            <div class="qa-item qa-item-mint">
              <p class="qa-question"><span class="q-icon">☘</span> Q1 · 你是誰？</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">大家好，我是小象（Elephlow）。一名獨立編輯和內容創意工作者，常年穿梭於港台流行文化、獨立出版、影展研究與酷兒書寫之間。網路上找我，在 IG / Threads 叫 <a href="https://www.instagram.com/icarusrootedbutflow/" target="_blank">@icarusrootedbutflow</a>。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-divider">✿ ⋆ ✿ ⋆ ✿</div>

            <div class="qa-item qa-item-aqua">
              <p class="qa-question"><span class="q-icon">✦</span> Q2 · 「推開部屋的門」是什麼？</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">一份創辦於 2022 年 7 月的中文付費電子報。<strong>三季已完結，共 48 期</strong>，第四季 2026 啟動。內容圍繞港台日韓獨立文化的邊緣 ── 書店、Zine、酷兒、聲響、影像。第四季從固定欄目轉向<strong>主題策展</strong>，每一期都像一本小型獨立雜誌的單期：做得窄，做得深。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-divider">✦ ⋆ ✦ ⋆ ✦</div>

            <div class="qa-item qa-item-pink">
              <p class="qa-question"><span class="q-icon">✿</span> Q3 · 為什麼寫這份小報？</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">平台的演算法把好東西藏起來，把不需要的東西推到你面前。我想反過來 ── 選好的、慢的、不必走紅但值得看的東西，寫給願意慢下来讀的人。</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">讀者收到的不是熱搜上能看到的東西，而是：</p>
              <ul class="qa-list-inner">
                <li>✿ 打破資訊差的整合性內容</li>
                <li>✦ 不摻商業利益的誠實寫作</li>
                <li>☘ 一個真實的人的陪伴感</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="text-divider">☘ ⋆ ☘ ⋆ ☘</div>

            <div class="qa-item qa-item-cream">
              <p class="qa-question"><span class="q-icon">♡</span> Q4 · 第四季有什麼不一樣？</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">三件大事：</p>
              <ul class="qa-list-inner">
                <li>☘ <strong>正刊轉向主題策展</strong>：每期一個切入點 ── 某件物、某個文學人物、某種音樂風格 ── 當成小型策展的中心。</li>
                <li>✦ <strong>雜誌通信頻率加快</strong>：副刊從月更變成每月多期，每篇 1000 字左右，聚焦某本雜誌的某一期具體在做什麼。</li>
                <li>✿ <strong>外部供稿者加入</strong>：邀請更多中港台寫作者，讓多元、在地的聲音進來。</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="text-divider">♡ ⋆ ♡ ⋆ ♡</div>

            <div class="qa-item qa-item-purple">
              <p class="qa-question"><span class="q-icon">✶</span> Q5 · 怎麼找到我？</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">
                ✉ 訂閱第四季：<a href="https://tally.so/r/4415XB" target="_blank">tally.so/r/4415XB</a><br/>
                ◉ instagram / threads：<a href="https://www.instagram.com/icarusrootedbutflow/" target="_blank">@icarusrootedbutflow</a><br/>
                ◉ 小紅書：搜「流星小飛象」<br/>
                ◉ 撰稿、採訪、合作邀請：透過上面任一管道私訊
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>

          <div class="qa-footer">
            <p>(｡♡‿♡｡) thanks for reading ✿</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="about-right sticky-sidebar">
        <div class="menu-card">
            <h3 class="menu-title">▼ MENU ▼</h3>
            <ul class="menu-list">
             <ul class="menu-list">
  <li><a href="/zh-tw/" class="menu-mint">🏠 主頁</a></li>
  <li><a href="/zh-tw/about" class="menu-pink">✍️ 創作者說</a></li>
  <li><a href="/zh-tw/archive" class="menu-aqua">📚 往期目錄</a></li>
  <li><a href="/zh-tw/guestbook" class="menu-purple">💬 留言板</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://tally.so/r/4415XB" class="menu-cream">★ 訂閱 ★</a></li>
</ul>
            </ul>
          </div>

        <div class="minihome-deco">
          <div class="deco-row">✦ ✿ ☘ ♡ ✦</div>
          <div class="deco-text">
            <p>this is a quiet</p>
            <p>little room ｡^‿^｡</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="kawaii-player">
          <div class="kp-header">
            <span class="kp-dot"></span>♫ NOW PLAYING<span class="kp-dot"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="kp-screen">
            <div class="kp-marquee">
              <span>馮穎琪 - 彳亍 ✿ 馮穎琪 - 彳亍 ✿</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="kp-controls">
            <span class="kp-btn kp-prev"></span>
            <span class="kp-btn kp-play"></span>
            <span class="kp-btn kp-next"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="kawaii-counter">
          <p class="kc-title">✿ VISITORS ✿</p>
          <div class="kc-digits">
            <span>0</span><span>0</span><span>1</span><span>4</span><span>2</span><span>6</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>

    <footer class="window-taskbar">
      <div class="taskbar-left">
        <span class="taskbar-start">⊞ START</span>
      </div>
      <div class="taskbar-right">
        <span class="taskbar-status">(｡♡‿♡｡) currently online</span>
        <span class="taskbar-clock" id="clock">--:--</span>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </main>

  <script is:inline>
    function updateClock() {
      const now = new Date();
      const h = String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, '0');
      const m = String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, '0');
      const el = document.getElementById('clock');
      if (el) el.innerText = `${h}:${m}`;
    }
    updateClock();
    setInterval(updateClock, 30000);
  </script>

  <style>
    /* === 基础容器 === */
    .home-window {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: 24px auto;
      background: var(--soft-white);
      border: 3px dashed var(--candy-mint);
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 rgba(181, 232, 224, 0.6);
      /* 注意：这里删除了 overflow: hidden; 这是保证 sticky 吸顶生效的关键！ */
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .window-titlebar {
      background: var(--candy-mint);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--candy-mint);
      border-radius: 13px 13px 0 0; /* 手动给顶部加上圆角 */
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .titlebar-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .title-dots { color: var(--candy-purple); letter-spacing: 2px; }
    .titlebar-text { letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .titlebar-right { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
    .lang-link {
      padding: 2px 8px;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
    .lang-link:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); }
    .lang-active { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); font-weight: 700; }

    .window-content { padding: 24px; }

    .about-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr 200px;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: start; /* 必须是 start，这样边栏自身高度才不会被拉伸，才能滑动！ */
    }

    /* === 【核心魔法】：吸顶跟随 === */
    .sticky-sidebar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 24px; /* 距离浏览器顶部 24px 处悬停 */
      height: fit-content;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink-light);
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed currentColor;
    }

    /* === 左侧卡片 === */
    .elephant-portrait {
      background: var(--soft-white);
      border: 2px dashed var(--candy-pink);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px 16px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(255, 182, 217, 0.35);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .elephant-portrait svg { width: 120px; height: auto; }
    .elephant-caption {
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--ink-light);
      margin-top: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .persona-card {
      background: var(--candy-mint);
      border: 1.5px dashed var(--candy-purple);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(181, 232, 224, 0.6);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .persona-list {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-tc);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .persona-list dt {
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 9px;
      color: var(--candy-purple);
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .persona-list dt:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    .persona-list dd {
      font-size: 12.5px; /* 稍微缩小一点点字号适应长英文 */
      margin-left: 0;
      margin-top: 2px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .interests-card {
      background: var(--candy-cream);
      border: 1.5px dashed var(--candy-peach);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(255, 233, 182, 0.5);
    }
    .pixel-bars { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .p-bar-group { width: 100%; display: block; }
    .p-bar-label {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
      font-family: var(--font-serif-tc); font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: 700;
    }
    .p-bar-track {
      width: 100%; height: 14px;
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      border: 1px dashed var(--candy-purple);
      border-radius: 8px; padding: 2px; box-sizing: border-box; 
    }
    .p-bar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; }

    /* 手账小贴纸 */
    .retro-stickers-area {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding: 0 10px;
    }
    .r-sticker {
      display: inline-block;
      align-self: flex-start;
      font-family: var(--font-mochi);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--ink);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border: 1.5px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      border-radius: 0 12px 12px 12px; 
      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      transition: transform 0.2s;
      cursor: default;
    }
    .r-sticker:hover { transform: scale(1.05) rotate(0deg) !important; }
    .sticker-a { background: var(--candy-pink); transform: rotate(-3deg); }
    .sticker-b { background: var(--candy-aqua); align-self: flex-end; transform: rotate(4deg); }

    /* 彩色炫动 Banner */
    .retro-s4-banner {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        -45deg,
        var(--candy-cream),
        var(--candy-cream) 10px,
        #fff 10px,
        #fff 20px
      );
      padding: 6px;
      border: 2px dashed var(--candy-purple);
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--candy-mint);
      animation: candy-stripe 3s linear infinite;
    }
    .s4-banner-inner {
      background: var(--candy-purple);
      color: var(--soft-white);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .blink-text {
      color: var(--candy-peach);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      animation: retro-blink 1.5s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes candy-stripe { 0% { background-position: 0 0; } 100% { background-position: 28px 28px; } }
    @keyframes retro-blink { 0%, 49% { opacity: 1; } 50%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; } }

    /* === 中间 QA === */
    .qa-card {
      background: var(--soft-white);
      border: 2px dashed var(--candy-mint);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 28px 32px;
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(181, 232, 224, 0.4);
    }
    .qa-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-tc);
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink-light);
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
    }
    .qa-subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--font-rounded);
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--candy-purple);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .qa-item {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin: 0 -8px;
    }
    .qa-item-mint   { background: rgba(200, 233, 176, 0.25); }
    .qa-item-aqua   { background: rgba(181, 232, 224, 0.25); }
    .qa-item-pink   { background: rgba(255, 182, 217, 0.25); }
    .qa-item-cream  { background: rgba(255, 233, 182, 0.3); }
    .qa-item-purple { background: rgba(199, 179, 232, 0.25); }

    .qa-question {
      font-family: var(--font-mochi);
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--candy-purple);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .q-icon { margin-right: 4px; }
    .qa-answer {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-tc);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .qa-answer:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .qa-answer strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      background: linear-gradient(transparent 60%, var(--candy-aqua) 60%);
    }
    .qa-answer a {
      color: var(--candy-purple);
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--candy-purple);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .qa-answer a:hover { background: var(--candy-cream); }
    .qa-list-inner {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-tc);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: var(--ink);
      padding-left: 0;
      list-style: none;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .qa-list-inner li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .qa-list-inner strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      background: linear-gradient(transparent 60%, var(--candy-aqua) 60%);
    }
    .text-divider {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--candy-purple);
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      margin: 16px 0;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
    .qa-footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--candy-mint);
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--ink-light);
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    /* === 右侧 Tabs (加上白色外描边) === */
    /* === 彩色长方形导航菜单 === */
    .menu-card {
      background: var(--soft-white);
      border: 1.5px dashed var(--candy-mint);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 8px;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(181, 232, 224, 0.4);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .menu-title {
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 8px 4px;
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      color: var(--ink-light);
      background: var(--candy-cream);
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .menu-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
    .menu-list li { margin-bottom: 4px; }

    .menu-list a {
      display: block;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--font-rounded);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1.5px dashed var(--candy-purple);
      transition: transform 0.15s;
      text-shadow: -1px -1px 0 var(--soft-white), 1px -1px 0 var(--soft-white), -1px 1px 0 var(--soft-white), 1px 1px 0 var(--soft-white);
    }

    .menu-list a:hover {
      transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(199, 179, 232, 0.4);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .menu-mint { background: var(--candy-mint); }
